m/retrokompott\">Twitter</a>, </strong><strong>auf </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/retrokompott/?fref=ts\">Facebook</a>, </strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><strong>oder auf unser </strong><strong><a href=\"http://www.retrokompott.de\">Homepage</a></strong><strong>.</strong></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Unterstuetzen kann man den Podcast bei <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/retrokompott?ty=h\">PATREON</a><br />\n</span></span></div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Die Links aus dem Podcast:</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid1145\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><a href=\"http://thndr.me/Lzeshs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“Back &#8222;BIT Symphonic&#8220;, the 8-disk C64 orchestral Kickstarter</a>  </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid1146\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959 url\"><a href=\"http://thndr.me/Lzeshs\">http://thndr.me/Lzeshs</a></span><span class=\"author-p-75959\">”   </span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">                          </span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid1148\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><a href=\"http://www.symphonica64.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.symphonica64.com</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid1154\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"http://www.ebay.de/itm/Ultra-RARE-Commodore-65-prototype-aka-DX64-or-C90-fully-working-see-video/141796044241?_trksid=p2047675.c100011.m1850&amp;_trkparms=aid%3D222007%26algo%3DSIC.MBE%26ao%3D1%26asc%3D33658%26meid%3D847145ca13f84f4a871992b1996153